; One variable: the theme text outline of LinkButton (link_button.cpp:294-301), the
; FoldableContainer title (foldable_container.cpp:310-312) and ItemList items
; (item_list.cpp:1642-1644,1673-1675). Each draws a red outline_size 8 ring under its text.
; The Hebrew rows are AUTO and trimmed: the ring trims by the inferred RTL direction and
; draws its ellipsis first, while the fill draws by the set AUTO direction
; (text_server.cpp:1740-1935), so ring and fill differ. No other fixture of these Controls
; sets outline_size.

